      "side": 1,
      "message": "Oh, seems that I made some confusion.\n\nActually this patchset isn\u0027t meant to be merged into main (thus I put WIP). These are simply a cherry-picks from main to the top of currently released servo_v4p1 firmware.\n\nWe don\u0027t have any branch for servo_v4p1 so far, thus I have used main as a target. The whole idea is to take tip of this patchset (create a servo_v4p1 branch?) make a build which will be a release candidate for servo_v4p1 firmware.\n\nOnce again - these patches already _are_ merged to main. This is solely for the rolling out purposes.",
      "parentUuid": "147016a2_0b2a53a5",
      "revId": "02e5f2263e4872948ca8e05ef0a01f2640170f30",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
